# Terraform Module: S3 + RDS + IAM

Structure:

```
infra/
├── modules/
│   ├── s3-bucket/
│   ├── rds-postgres/
│   └── service-role/
├── envs/
│   ├── dev/
│   │   ├── main.tf
│   │   ├── backend.tf
│   │   └── dev.tfvars.enc   (sops-encrypted)
│   └── prod/
│       ├── main.tf
│       ├── backend.tf
│       └── prod.tfvars.enc
└── versions.tf
```

## Shared pin

**`versions.tf`**
```hcl
terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.6"
  required_providers {
    aws = { source = "hashicorp/aws", version = "~> 5.0" }
  }
}
```

## Module: S3 bucket

**`modules/s3-bucket/main.tf`**
```hcl
resource "aws_s3_bucket" "this" {
  bucket = var.name
  tags   = var.tags
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket_versioning" "this" {
  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.this.id
  versioning_configuration { status = "Enabled" }
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration" "this" {
  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.this.id
  rule {
    apply_server_side_encryption_by_default {
      sse_algorithm     = var.kms_key_arn != null ? "aws:kms" : "AES256"
      kms_master_key_id = var.kms_key_arn
    }
    bucket_key_enabled = true
  }
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block" "this" {
  bucket                  = aws_s3_bucket.this.id
  block_public_acls       = true
  block_public_policy     = true
  ignore_public_acls      = true
  restrict_public_buckets = true
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket_replication_configuration" "this" {
  count  = var.replication_bucket_arn != null ? 1 : 0
  role   = aws_iam_role.replication[0].arn
  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.this.id

  rule {
    id     = "cross-region"
    status = "Enabled"
    destination { bucket = var.replication_bucket_arn }
  }
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "replication" {
  count = var.replication_bucket_arn != null ? 1 : 0
  name  = "${var.name}-replication"
  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [{ Effect = "Allow", Action = "sts:AssumeRole",
      Principal = { Service = "s3.amazonaws.com" } }]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy" "replication" {
  count = var.replication_bucket_arn != null ? 1 : 0
  name  = "replication"
  role  = aws_iam_role.replication[0].id
  policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [{
      Effect = "Allow"
      Action = ["s3:GetReplicationConfiguration", "s3:ListBucket", "s3:GetObjectVersionForReplication", "s3:GetObjectVersionAclForReplication", "s3:GetObjectVersionTaggingForReplication", "s3:ReplicateObject", "s3:ReplicateDelete", "s3:ReplicateTags"]
      Resource = [aws_s3_bucket.this.arn, "${aws_s3_bucket.this.arn}/*", var.replication_bucket_arn, "${var.replication_bucket_arn}/*"]
    }]
  })
}
```

**`modules/s3-bucket/variables.tf`** and **`outputs.tf`**
```hcl
variable "name"                { type = string }
variable "kms_key_arn"         { type = string, default = null }
variable "replication_bucket_arn" { type = string, default = null }
variable "tags"                { type = map(string), default = {} }

output "bucket_arn"  { value = aws_s3_bucket.this.arn }
output "bucket_name" { value = aws_s3_bucket.this.id }
```

## Module: RDS PostgreSQL

**`modules/rds-postgres/main.tf`**
```hcl
resource "aws_db_subnet_group" "this" {
  name       = var.name
  subnet_ids = var.subnet_ids
}

resource "aws_security_group" "this" {
  name_prefix = "${var.name}-db-"
  vpc_id      = var.vpc_id
  ingress {
    from_port       = 5432
    to_port         = 5432
    protocol        = "tcp"
    security_groups = var.allowed_security_groups
  }
  egress { from_port = 0, to_port = 0, protocol = "-1", cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"] }
}

resource "aws_db_instance" "this" {
  identifier                   = var.name
  engine                       = "postgres"
  engine_version               = var.engine_version
  instance_class               = var.instance_class
  allocated_storage            = var.allocated_storage
  db_name                      = var.db_name
  username                     = var.db_username
  manage_master_user_password  = true   # Secrets Manager, never in plaintext
  multi_az                     = var.multi_az
  storage_encrypted            = true
  deletion_protection          = true
  publicly_accessible          = false
  backup_retention_period      = max(var.backup_retention_days, 7)
  db_subnet_group_name         = aws_db_subnet_group.this.name
  vpc_security_group_ids       = [aws_security_group.this.id]
  skip_final_snapshot          = false
  final_snapshot_identifier   = "${var.name}-final"
  auto_minor_version_upgrade   = true
}
```

**`modules/rds-postgres/variables.tf`** / **`outputs.tf`**
```hcl
variable "name"                   { type = string }
variable "vpc_id"                 { type = string }
variable "subnet_ids"             { type = list(string) }
variable "allowed_security_groups" { type = list(string), default = [] }
variable "instance_class"         { type = string }
variable "multi_az"               { type = bool, default = false }
variable "allocated_storage"      { type = number, default = 20 }
variable "engine_version"         { type = string, default = "16.3" }
variable "db_name"                { type = string, default = "appdb" }
variable "db_username"            { type = string, default = "appadmin" }
variable "backup_retention_days"  { type = number, default = 7 }

output "endpoint"    { value = aws_db_instance.this.endpoint }
output "db_arn"      { value = aws_db_instance.this.arn }
output "sg_id"       { value = aws_security_group.this.id }
```

## Module: IAM service role (OIDC)

**`modules/service-role/main.tf`**
```hcl
data "aws_iam_policy_document" "trust" {
  statement {
    effect  = "Allow"
    actions = ["sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity"]
    principals {
      type        = "Federated"
      identifiers = ["arn:aws:iam::${var.account_id}:oidc-provider/${var.oidc_provider}"]
    }
    condition {
      test     = "StringEquals"
      variable = "${var.oidc_provider}:sub"
      values   = ["system:serviceaccount:${var.k8s_namespace}:${var.service_account}"]
    }
  }
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "this" {
  name               = var.name
  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.trust.json
}

# Least privilege: exact bucket actions, no wildcards
resource "aws_iam_role_policy" "assets" {
  name = "assets-access"
  role = aws_iam_role.this.id
  policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [{
      Effect = "Allow"
      Action = ["s3:GetObject", "s3:PutObject", "s3:DeleteObject", "s3:ListBucket"]
      Resource = [var.bucket_arn, "${var.bucket_arn}/*"]
    }]
  })
}
```

**`modules/service-role/variables.tf`** / **`outputs.tf`**
```hcl
variable "name"             { type = string }
variable "account_id"       { type = string }
variable "oidc_provider"    { type = string }
variable "k8s_namespace"    { type = string }
variable "service_account"  { type = string }
variable "bucket_arn"       { type = string }

output "role_arn" { value = aws_iam_role.this.arn }
```

## Environment: prod (dev is identical with different tfvars)

**`envs/prod/main.tf`**
```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = var.region
}

module "assets" {
  source                = "../../modules/s3-bucket"
  name                  = "${var.environment}-app-assets"
  kms_key_arn           = var.kms_key_arn
  replication_bucket_arn = var.replica_bucket_arn
  tags                  = local.tags
}

module "db" {
  source     = "../../modules/rds-postgres"
  name       = "${var.environment}-app-db"
  vpc_id     = var.vpc_id
  subnet_ids = var.db_subnet_ids
  allowed_security_groups = var.app_sg_ids
  instance_class = var.db_instance_class
  multi_az       = var.db_multi_az
}

module "app_role" {
  source          = "../../modules/service-role"
  name            = "${var.environment}-app-sa"
  account_id      = data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id
  oidc_provider   = var.oidc_provider
  k8s_namespace   = var.k8s_namespace
  service_account = var.service_account
  bucket_arn      = module.assets.bucket_arn
}

data "aws_caller_identity" "current" {}

locals { tags = { Environment = var.environment, ManagedBy = "terraform" } }

output "db_endpoint" { value = module.db.endpoint }
output "bucket"      { value = module.assets.bucket_name }
output "role_arn"    { value = module.app_role.role_arn }
```

**`envs/prod/backend.tf`** — separate state per env guarantees isolation:
```hcl
terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket = "tfstate-prod"
    key    = "app/prod.tfstate"
    region = "us-east-1"
  }
}
```

**`envs/prod/variables.tf`**
```hcl
variable "region"            { type = string }
variable "environment"       { type = string }
variable "vpc_id"            { type = string }
variable "db_subnet_ids"     { type = list(string) }
variable "app_sg_ids"        { type = list(string) }
variable "db_instance_class" { type = string }
variable "db_multi_az"       { type = bool }
variable "kms_key_arn"       { type = string, default = null }
variable "replica_bucket_arn" { type = string, default = null }
variable "oidc_provider"     { type = string }
variable "k8s_namespace"     { type = string, default = "app" }
variable "service_account"   { type = string, default = "app" }
```

## tfvars (SOPS-encrypted files committed; plaintext never in Git)

**`envs/dev/dev.tfvars`** (encrypted as `dev.tfvars.enc`)
```hcl
region            = "us-east-1"
environment       = "dev"
vpc_id            = "vpc-0abc"
db_subnet_ids     = ["subnet-1", "subnet-2"]
app_sg_ids        = ["sg-0123"]
db_instance_class = "db.t3.micro"
db_multi_az       = false
oidc_provider     = "oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/EXAMPLE"
```

**`envs/prod/prod.tfvars`** (encrypted)
```hcl
region             = "us-east-1"
environment        = "prod"
vpc_id             = "vpc-0def"
db_subnet_ids      = ["subnet-3", "subnet-4", "subnet-5"]
app_sg_ids         = ["sg-0456"]
db_instance_class  = "db.t3.medium"
db_multi_az        = true
kms_key_arn        = "arn:aws:kms:us-east-1:123:key/..."
replica_bucket_arn = "arn:aws:s3:::prod-app-assets-replica-usw2"
oidc_provider      = "oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/EXAMPLE2"
```

## Deploy

```bash
cd envs/dev
sops -d dev.tfvars.enc > /tmp/dev.tfvars
terraform init && terraform apply -var-file=/tmp/dev.tfvars
```

## Acceptance criteria mapping

| Criterion | How |
|---|---|
| Versioning + SSE, no public access | `aws_s3_bucket_versioning`, SSE config (AES256/KMS), `public_access_block` all-true |
| Deletion protection, backups ≥7, not public | `deletion_protection=true`, `max(retention,7)`, `publicly_accessible=false` |
| No plaintext secrets in Git | `manage_master_user_password` (Secrets Manager), SOPS-encrypted tfvars |
| Least privilege IAM | OIDC trust scoped to one namespace/SA; policy lists exact actions/resources — no `*` |
| Env isolation | Separate backends/state, separate tfvars; dev deploy cannot touch prod |
